24T00:20:18.081Z","creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7169897329,"name":"Nanny [HORROR]","desc":"🌟 Hello! Welcome to Nanny [HORROR]. Avoid Nanny and find the exit to survive!\n👍 Like ⭐Favorite and 🔊 Follow the game for more updates!\n\n❗NEXT UPDATE: NO UPDATE SCHEDULED\n\nControls: \n💻 \"Shift\" to crawl.\n🎮 \"X\" to crawl.\n\n📲 Avaiable Platforms: Mobile, Console, PC, Tablet\n ❗ This game contains jumpscare. Play at your own risk.","path":"/game/7169897329-nanny","slug":"7169897329-nanny","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/42ac3400782461a2828e7bfc25c311895904937f32053b6f99e39ab79be1eefc.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-4af36153b0bb4318464c8fc086718ffe/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":23,"visitor":189268231,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-10-18T09:43:28.041Z","creator":{"name":"ECB Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":730951264,"name":"The Maze","desc":"WARNING: FLASHING LIGHTS AND LOUD NOISES!\r\n\r\n------- SHORT ANNOUNCEMENT.\r\nAt the moment, this game is in a very early state, me and my small team have been working on a REBOOT for this game, planning out story elements, designs and ideas for the future of this project.\r\nDevelopment on The Maze Reboot has been a bit slow due to things like life but also because of my other projects which I will soon be finishing so I can dedicate myself to this game once again!\r\nHowever, I do want to announce that I plan to get a DEMO for The Maze Reboot out sometime in the future (also known as Update 4.5). Who knows how long it will take but thank you all for the support on this small project!\r\nThis is only the beginning!\r\n---------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nThis game was made for people looking for a scare. Perhaps people who like exploring. This is a very open game but once you get into the Maze, it gets very enclosed.","path":"/ga